OL,3,GNEWSAElderly man suffers head injury in
OL,4,Ae-bike crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn elderly man suffered head injuries
OL,7,Fwhen he was knocked over by an e-bike
OL,8,Fin Leicester.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said the
OL,11,Fpedestrian was hit by an electric pedal
OL,12,Fcycle in Aikman Avenue, close to the
OL,13,Fshops at the St Oswalds Road junction,
OL,14,Fshortly after 17:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,16,FThe rider of the bike stopped but left
OL,17,Fthe scene before police arrived. The
OL,18,Fman was taken to hospital with head
OL,19,Finjuries.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
